ing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 collectible golf balls hidden throughout the courses (plus more in additional DLC courses). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for Teleport and Smooth locomotion, as well as the ability to fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills with a driving range, practice green and other features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable commemorative putters for each course through Foxhunts on Hard Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable avatars featuring lip sync and over a <strong>QUADRILLION</strong> combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full crossplay between all VR platforms.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English, French, Spanish, German, Japanese, Korean and Chinese.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Escape into a fun and beautiful world filled with the best mini golf courses you’ve ever seen! Play by yourself, meet someone new, or challenge your friends in a private game with up to 8 people. Extremely realistic physics create the perfect experience for hardcore golfers and casual players alike.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/41550e311799d354df465ebce3d7a0885eec4409/header.jpg?t=1787339302", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/6e559036ba440ffa50cd5942fad2d57b0a3c841e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787339302", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408230/6e559036ba440ffa50cd5942fad2d57b0a3c841e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787339302", "website": "https://mightycoconut.com/minigolf/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 